# Tools wheel spacing

A tools-wheel page with fewer than 8 items must sit at **equal angles** around the ring, starting at the top and going clockwise: 3 tools at thirds (0° / 120° / 240°), 4 at quarters, 5 at fifths, and so on. Do not pack leftovers into the first wedges.

When adding a tool to a page that is not yet full, keep that even spacing. Start a new page instead of putting a 9th item on a full ring.
